'' '--dump-ir-pre-abi' shows the MIR the frontend made, then the ABI pass's (review MIR-07): a
'' UDT passed by value is an aggregate parameter before the pass and a pointer after it.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 --dump-ir-pre-abi tests/mir/verify/src/pre-abi.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT-SEQ: func i32 F(agg:20[M] $0) {
'' EXPECT-OUT-SEQ: -- pre-abi --
'' EXPECT-OUT-SEQ: func i32 F(ptr $0) {
'' EXPECT-OUT-SEQ: verify: ok
